DDIIAAGGNNOOSSTTIICCSS
     ccuu prints ``Data terminal ready'' once the serial line is
     open, and ``Hangup'' when the line drops.

NNOOTTEESS
     This ccuu is only a terminal emulator for a single serial
     line; it has no dialing directory or telephone-number
     database, and cannot look up or dial a remote system by
     name.  Pattern matching (~mm) is not implemented in this ver-
     sion.  The built-in command summary printed by ~?  still
     describes ~pp as a pattern search; in this version that let-
     ter instead starts a file transfer, as documented above.
